{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>They shall teach Your ordinances to Jacob.</b> Since they do not show favoritism, they are fit to teach Your ordinances. And thus it says: ואת עמי יורו etc., and it is written: ובאת אל הכהנים הלוים והגידו לך את דבר המשפט. Another interpretation: <b>They shall teach Your ordinances</b> — because they are free, for they have no inheritance to occupy them and cause them to neglect words of Torah."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:55:23.157440386Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}